  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）\n07:55 A.M    天气/阴\n龙门接舷区，落蹄州，罗德岛七号舱室"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "在本小姐和罗德岛的接应下，阻挠你们的整合运动溃散了，而你的小队相对保持了完整。哼哼，你总算可以回龙门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "在你觉得事情告一段落了的时候，你正面吃了一发爆炸，昏了过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "你是想问“你因为被人偷袭昏了过去”是不是真的，还是想问“你被爆炸正面掀翻在地却仅仅只是昏了过去”是不是真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "算了，别扯了。现在龙门的整体状况呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "一团糟，具体的自己去看简报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "不管之前发生了什么事，我们反攻的整体进度已经被你拖慢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "现在，特别督察组应该调集近卫局的残余队伍，和罗德岛一同向近卫局出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "一路深入上城区吗。机动作战？似乎确实能起到效果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "只不过这样的作战有什么意义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "沿路捣毁所有的整合运动据点。我们会接手你们建立的优势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "攻坚战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "没错，趁整合运动还没立足脚跟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但是，摧毁据点之后，干道枢纽周边残余的整合运动会迅速合流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你根本不能保证你能坚持到我们夺回近卫局，更别说是在这之后清剿散布各处的整合运动了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我们并不需要你所谓的“建立优势”，我也不需要你来教我制订计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "那可由不得你，陈警司，就算你是特别督查组组长、在战时拥有特别调遣权及现场执行权，你也不可能逃避所有责任的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "听你的语气，你是想挑战我。这当然可以，但不是现在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我们肩负着不同的使命，我们该做的只是执行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "陈警司，近卫局失守了，整个近卫局大楼都被整合运动控制着，这是你的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "当龙门需要你的时候，你为什么不在龙门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "这也是你接到的命令？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "没有你的擅离职守，龙门不会失陷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "诗怀雅",
      "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
      "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
      "text": "我替你感到羞耻，陈警司。你该马上辞职，而我会接管特别督查组。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
